// Torex XC6206P332MR, the 3.3 V regulator marked 662K on the common SSD1306 OLED modules.
// Values are from Torex ETR0305_004b: the p5 Electrical Characteristics Chart row for 3.3 V,
// the p4 table, and the p3 absolute maximum ratings.
